  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project will identify, incubate, and bring to market readiness transformative projects that help leverage co-financing from, but not limited to, venture capitalists, pension funds, philanthropies, bilateral partners and even domestic fiscal financing. The project will seek to unlock domestic liquidity/capital using development finance as de-risking capital to create a strong business case for attracting foreign investments in the green and blue economy space. This Project plans to support invest</narrative>
